uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>我与奠基石女士已经抵达基金会下属办事处的建筑主体内部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>我们处于会客厅位置，暂时没有骚灵现象发生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>其他人请携带好按照标准仪式调配好的“硝化大蒜提取液”，填装入基金会制式除灵装置后在南入口处待命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>奠基石女士，我们准备好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>真令人安心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……“鬼魂”，它不会主动现身吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>在我看过的一些电影里，这样的“鬼魂”通常会用无形的手拉扯受害者的脖颈，或者悄悄地把锐器送进他们的动脉里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这儿有些太过安静了，它从不和你们沟通吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>不，它从未尝试和我们用语言沟通过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>但我确信，一旦我们盲目地在建筑里展开搜寻，那些发生在我和我同僚身上的可怕事情一定会再次上演。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>用五厘米厚的员工手册砸你们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>更糟，它会把你当作乒乓球打来打去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>好吧……我刚从诺瓦米奇学到的小招式或许会派上用场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你介意我在这里使用神秘术吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>不介意，但您需要对使用的场合及原因作出说明，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>好吧，我的朋友告诉我，“鬼魂”通常是有关“过往”的存在，而且依附于建筑或其他物体的“鬼魂”并不少见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>——想知道它的面貌，我只需要叩问这栋建筑本身就好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>几何想要成为的模样会诚实地通过轮廓展现出来——一只郊狼？一块立方？还是一轮新月？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>只需要找到能填充砖石轮廓的念想……</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>就是这儿了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jiankongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jiankongshi\"><img alt=\"jiankongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jiankongshi.png/600px-Cg-jiankongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jiankongshi.png/900px-Cg-jiankongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/Cg-jiankongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jiankongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>这里是办事处的监控中心。我们可以在这里通过摄像头掌握建筑内各个角落的情况；您也可以通过那边的通讯器向建筑内发起广播。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这就是我需要的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>不需要能够和“鬼魂”沟通的神秘学家，不需要第三类神秘频段，这就是为你量身定制的发声器官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>现在，和大家打个招呼吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-653910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-653910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-653910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……你们好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从广播喇叭处传来了一声稚嫩的问候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>这是怎么一回事，奠基石女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我和这栋建筑“沟通”过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这儿没有什么“鬼魂”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>问题在于这栋建筑本身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>您是说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>基金会职员迅速地翻阅了一下手上的文件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>我们的办事处建筑主体……罕见地成为了一位意识唤醒者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“建筑”：</div><div>这是我的名字吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>不，你可以有一个你自己喜欢的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>好吧……和活生生的建筑聊天这种童话对我的年龄来说有些不太合适了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>咳，你可以不要用你的神秘术将住在你身体里的人们赶走吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>建筑是人类居住空间的整合，他们需要一个办公和生活的空间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“建筑”：</div><div>我拒绝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“建筑”：</div><div>这些，神秘学家，人类，住在我的身体里，很不舒服。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“建筑”：</div><div>大蒜，符咒，灵摆，精盐。很不舒服！不要再用这些砸我了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>这个脾气真是和我的老朋友如出一辙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我郑重地替他们向你道歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“建筑”：</div><div>只有道歉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我……我想想，我们会重新为你刷一遍外漆，加固一遍你的结构，延长你的使用寿命……或者你想要一个更华丽的室内装潢风格？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>奠基石女士，我们没有那么多预算……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“建筑”：</div><div>哼，人类又在用自己狭隘的观念去揣度别人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你知道的好像很多，但理论上你才诞生了不久。这是某种意识唤醒者的特性吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>只需要一年就能成为合格的行为责任人和合法劳力……我想我突然明白为什么基金会会有那么多不愿意好好长着人类脑袋的员工了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“建筑”：</div><div>我说过的，我需要懂如何建房子的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>所以我来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>当我听到你需要一个“懂得建筑”的人的时候，我本以为你或许需要一位建筑师来维护或者优化你的身体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>但是你亲口否认了这点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“建筑”：</div><div>教我，教我如何搭建一栋房子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>你又没有手……哦，你的神秘术。假如你能将数十个健康的成年人像玩具一样扔来扔去，那或许独自完成施工对你来说并不算难事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>尽管从安全评估的角度来说，我非常不推荐这么做就是了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“建筑”：</div><div>……假如你可以教会我，或许我会同意你们住进来。我知道，你们都是这么做交易的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我可以问一下原因吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-653901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“建筑”：</div><div>不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>好吧，听上去我们别无选择了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>基金会大概也搞不到第二块地理位置更好的地皮了。而这个年头拆栋房子居然也能涉及故意杀人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>女士，一位从未接受过相关教育的人士成为持证建筑师所需要的时间一般是多久？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>假如按照本地的规矩，我想大概需要五年攻读理论基础以及一年考取资格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>我……我想我们等不了那么久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>非常现实的问题。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_zhou\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>或许我们应该重新审视一下这场闹剧：在两周内迅速建成一栋能行使基金会办事处职能的建筑本就是不切实际的想法。它注定会失败。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>然后就像开玩笑似的，我们用于实验的建筑突然变成了一位意识唤醒者？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>我想我们已经没有任何理由像个笑话一样在这里熬下去了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>这栋建筑，它所使用的土地和混凝土都是基金会的财产！没有我们，它根本也不会诞生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>它本没有任何理由拒绝我们的入驻！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-506101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">基金会职员Ⅰ：</div><div>以及——你是说我们的一举一动都会被感觉到？那我也不打算回里面去了！这太恶心了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>您同意他们的观点吗，奠基石女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>是的，从理性层面考量，这是最好的办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>预制板结构建筑的建成周期和使用寿命或许完美地契合了基金会对于临时办事处的需求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>但假如“暴雨”会拽着我们一直向后走，或许总有一天，我们会前往一个不存在预制板结构技术的时代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>仅靠我作为建筑师的一点浅薄的见识……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我认为通过使用已有的当地建筑更能满足基金会在不同时代的办事需求，同时也能更好地在未知的新环境中融入当地社区。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>哦，我可没有做特工的志愿，这只是我在诺瓦米奇的一些心得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>所以，我的选择是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:138%\"><b>“迟早有一天，我们会前往一个连混凝土都不曾存在的时代。”</b></span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>——我要去为这栋建筑授课。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我会教会它最基础的建筑理论，我会在授课的同时说服它接纳你们的入驻。或许直到下一次“暴雨”落下前，这项任务都不会被完成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>奠基石女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我知道，我的想法是不合逻辑也没有必要的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>只有这一刻，我才意识到……我确实是个神秘学家。即便毫无道理可言，但激情呼唤我行动起来的时候，我总是会任由它摆布。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>我明白了……我支持您，奠基石女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>但这只是我一个人的坚持……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>现在是两个人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>斯塔夏女士，我作为基金会巴塞罗那临时办事处的总负责人，愿意带领所有职员帮助您完成这项任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>您……没提过您是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>和您比起来，或许我仍然是个小人物吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>当我听到这项计划的时候，我止不住地想……这和大多数神秘学家们提出的计划一样，缺乏落地依据，缺乏实际可操作性……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>但，我不得不承认。我想看到基金会的办事处在地球的各个角落开花结果，这样我们就不必隔着雨幕对许多事仅仅观望着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>或许另一个方向，利用该时代已有的适合基金会入驻的建筑确实是更睿智的选择……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">罗塞拉：</div><div>但我不想放弃另一种可能性，即便它注定会失败。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……我明白了。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "再会在新世界-03"}}